          },
          "create_time": 1760000540.0,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "That fixed it. Here's my env for reference: DATABASE_URL=postgres://localhost/billing and OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-4fJq8ZtW2mXv9KcR7nB3yLp6"
